# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# fumadocs generated source
.source/

# Local knowledge base — not committed. Anchored to the repo root: an
# unanchored "docs/" also matches content/docs/ (the actual fumadocs site
# content) and src/app/[lang]/docs/ (the docs route itself), silently
# excluding both from every commit.
/docs/

# AI agent instruction files — local-only per .claude/CLAUDE.md's own
# "no AI co-authorship" rule; kept out of the repo, at any depth (matches
# both the root ones and .claude/CLAUDE.md itself). AGENTS.md in particular
# is also regenerated on its own by `next dev`, so ignoring it is required,
# not just preferred.
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/GEMINI.md
**/.github/copilot-instructions.md
